      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/colonial-paper-money/new-jersey-6-shillings-1776/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"New Jersey Colony — Seis Chelines (1776)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/colonial-paper-money/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Colonial coin catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Colony of New Jersey &middot; Burlington &middot; 1776</span>\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">New Jersey Colony</h1>\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Six Shillings &middot; Bill of Credit, on the eve of independence</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"newjersey-6-shillings-1776\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/newjersey-6-shillings-1776-colonial.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/newjersey-6-shillings-1776-colonial.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Colonial Six Shillings banknote of New Jersey, obverse above with a stamped red seal and manuscript signatures, reverse below with a nature-print of a leaf and the warning To counterfeit is Death\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"696\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Colony</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Colony of New Jersey (present-day United States)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Six Shillings (6s)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">vintage rag paper</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Isaac Collins, Burlington, New Jersey</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">25 March 1776, the fourteenth year of George III's reign</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signatories</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Jo. Johnston &middot; Rob. Smith &middot; Jo. Smyth</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick/Friedberg n.&deg; NJ-178</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">The last months under the Crown:</strong>This note was issued on March 25, 1776, just a few months before the Declaration of Independence in July of that year, still under the formal authority of King George III &mdash;making it a testament to the final months of British colonial currency in North America.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Benjamin Franklin's leaf:</strong>The reverse features the impression of a natural leaf, a leaf vein transfer technique pioneered by Benjamin Franklin and his printing partner. Each leaf has a microscopically unique vein pattern impossible to replicate by hand, making it one of the most effective anti-counterfeiting measures on colonial American paper money.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>&ldquo;THIS BILL of Six Shillings Proclamation, is emitted by a LAW of the Colony of NEW-JERSEY, passed in the Fourteenth Year of the Reign of his Majesty King GEORGE the Third. Dated MARCH 25, 1776.&rdquo;</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Red stamped seal:</strong>circular security design in red ink on the left margin, along with the serial number and handwritten signatures of the three colonial officials.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>detailed impression of a natural leaf in the center, with the text &ldquo;Printed by Isaac Collins in New-Jersey, Burlington&rdquo; and the legal warning &ldquo;To counterfeit is Death&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ornamental borders:</strong>rows of rosettes and geometric fretwork repeated in the four margins of both sides, typical of colonial printing typography.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. Catalog reference according to Eric P. Newman,<em>The Early Paper Money of America</em>, and the Friedberg system of U.S. colonial and continental notes (designation NJ-178).</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">2. The technique of printing natural sheets as an anti-counterfeiting measure is widely documented as an innovation of Benjamin Franklin's printing press, adopted by several American colonies—including New Jersey—in their eighteenth-century paper money issues.</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n     \n     data-zoom-dialog=\"note-1\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n      <button\n        data-zoom-close\n        aria-label=\"Close\"\n        style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n      >&times;</button>\n\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button\n          disabled=\"true\"\n          aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&minus;</button>\n        <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button\n          disabled=\"false\"\n          aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div\n        style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n      >\n        <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/uploads/newjersey-6-shillings-1776-colonial.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n          <img\n            src=\"/uploads/newjersey-6-shillings-1776-colonial.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Banknote colonial de New Jersey, enlarged view\"\n            draggable=\"false\"\n            style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n\n      <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "New Jersey Colony",
      "eyebrow": "New Jersey Colony · Burlington · 1776"
    }
  }
